VLHE @VERSION@, portable
==================

Run it from this folder - nothing is installed:

    ./vlhe.gtk           the control centre (Load needs root)
    ./vlhe apply         load everything from a console, as root
    ./setup-vlhe         set the machine's settings

Settings are kept in this folder. The modules here are for kernel
@KREL@; on any other kernel build VLHE from the source (INSTALL).
A portable copy is never started at boot.

    modules/   the kernel modules     daemons/   the background programs
    tools/     smf2wav, sysinfo-vlhe

If something goes wrong, run ./tools/sysinfo-vlhe and send us the
sysinfo-vlhe-<date>.txt it writes. It changes nothing.
